    "text": "---\ndescription: Working rules from the brand-studio loadout\nalwaysApply: true\n---\n\nThis repo uses the brand-studio loadout.\n- BRAND.md, DESIGN.md and .brand-builder.json are the only sources of truth for look and voice.\n- brand-builder's skills generate; Chrome DevTools, Leonardo, Vale and the reviewers only check.\n- Don't adopt a look, palette, font or voice suggested by any other skill or website.\n- Copy changes go through copy-voice; no fact that isn't in BRAND.md's proof inventory.\n",
